<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
  <StorytellerDef ParentName="BaseStoryteller">
    <defName>PMP_MasonAndKaldalis</defName>
    <label>Mason and Kaldalis</label>
    <description>Mason brings a steady mix of preparation, opportunities and smaller conflicts. Kaldalis favors challenges, building battle drive during quiet periods and releasing it in bursts of threats.

Honor records how you command: facing enemies and caring for people earn respect; treating people as resources loses it. Honor changes colonists' morale and obedience, never the events they receive. At exceptional honor, burning colonists prioritize extinguishing themselves, and a personal appeal has a small chance to end a mental break. Self-rescue does not make them immune to fire.</description>
    <portraitLarge>Things/StoryTellers/M&amp;K</portraitLarge>
    <portraitTiny>Things/StoryTellers/M&amp;K_Tiny</portraitTiny>
    <listOrder>22</listOrder>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="PMP_Persona.Storyteller.MasonKaldalisConfig">
        <draftRefusalChance>0.02</draftRefusalChance>
        <dangerRefusalChance>0.04</dangerRefusalChance>
        <idlingChancePerDay>0.01</idlingChancePerDay>
        <refusalTicks>5000</refusalTicks>
        <recoveryChance>0.10</recoveryChance>
        <recoveryCooldownTicks>60000</recoveryCooldownTicks>
        <pulseIncidents>2</pulseIncidents>
        <pulseDurationMin>60000</pulseDurationMin>
        <pulseDurationMax>120000</pulseDurationMax>
        <rescueGraceTicks>6000</rescueGraceTicks>
        <inactivityDays>10</inactivityDays>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
    <comps>
      <li Class="PMP_Persona.Storyteller.StorytellerCompProperties_MasonKaldalis">
        <mtbDays>1.1</mtbDays>
        <categoryWeights>
          <ThreatBig>0.3</ThreatBig>
          <ThreatSmall>0.6</ThreatSmall>
          <Misc>1.0</Misc>
          <GiveQuest>0.7</GiveQuest>
          <DiseaseHuman>0.6</DiseaseHuman>
        </categoryWeights>
      </li>
      <li Class="PMP_Persona.Storyteller.StorytellerCompProperties_MasonKaldalis">
        <kaldalis>true</kaldalis>
        <mtbDays>1.6</mtbDays>
        <categoryWeights>
